<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As Spirit He speaks thru the Word</l><l>Till my heart in echo is singing,</l><l>And the fount of life with His grace and pow’r</l><l>Within my soul is springing.</l><l>And He speaks to me and reveals to me</l><l>All His riches for me today;</l><l>And I drink of Him for my every need,</l><l>My thirsting has passed away.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In tenderness He deals with me,</l><l>While I stay with joy in His presence;</l><l>And He saturates and supplies my soul</l><l>With all His precious essence.</l><l>And He speaks to me and reveals to me</l><l>All His riches for me today;</l><l>And in every way I partake of Him,</l><l>My problems all passed away.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
